---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import {services} from '../../data/services';
import {tracks} from '../../data/training';
const breadcrumbs=[{name:'Home',path:'/'},{name:'Training',path:'/training/'}];
---
<Layout title="Corporate AI Training in India | Salmon Joy" description="Compare practical AI training for business teams, developers and educators. On-site workshops across India and live online, with Salmon Joy." breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}>
<section class="editorial-hero dark-scene"><Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs}/><span class="eyebrow">PRACTICAL SKILLS. WORKING CONFIDENCE.</span><h1>Corporate AI training.<br/><em>Built around your team.</em></h1><p>Choose a path from everyday AI use to engineering and education. Hands-on training, on-site across India and live online for teams worldwide.</p><a href="#programmes" class="button button-ivory">Find your starting point <Icon/></a></section>
<section class="editorial-wrap" id="programmes"><div class="editorial-intro"><span class="eyebrow">THREE WAYS FORWARD</span><h2>Different starting points.<br/><em>Useful next steps.</em></h2><p>Start with the work your team needs to do. The audience, learning goal and current skills shape the discussion—not a fixed list of tools.</p></div><div class="service-grid">{services.map((s,i)=><article class="service-card"><span class="eyebrow">{tracks[i].audience}</span><span class="service-number">0{i+1}</span><h3><a href={tracks[i].url}>{tracks[i].title}</a></h3><p>{s.answer}</p><ul>{tracks[i].outcomes.map(o=><li>{o}</li>)}</ul><a class="text-link" href={tracks[i].url}>Explore the programme <Icon/></a></article>)}</div><div class="editorial-split"><div><h2>Engineering experience.<br/><em>Human explanations.</em></h2><p>Salmon Joy is an AI engineer and enterprise trainer based in Mumbai, with 8+ years of experience and 10,000+ learners trained.</p><p>Master Trainer for the OpenAI Programme in India, delivered through VMS Group APAC and Channel Partners Solutions, LLC.</p><a href="/about/" class="text-link">Meet your trainer <Icon/></a></div><aside class="evidence-panel"><span class="eyebrow">BEFORE WE BEGIN</span><h3>A useful workshop starts with a useful brief.</h3><ol><li>Tell me who is learning and their starting level.</li><li>Choose a real task or capability to work towards.</li><li>Agree on suitable exercises, tools and review criteria.</li></ol><a href="/insights/choose-corporate-ai-training/" class="text-link">Read the training checklist <Icon/></a></aside></div><p class="editorial-note">Training scope, dates, delivery format, access requirements and any costs are agreed through an enquiry. No fixed duration or certification is promised here.</p></section>
</Layout>
